# Git LFS — large binary assets
*.onnx        filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
test-corpus/** filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.zip         filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Normalize line endings
*.lua    text eol=lf
*.rs     text eol=lf
*.toml   text eol=lf
*.sh     text eol=lf
*.md     text eol=lf
*.xmp    text eol=lf
*.tmpl   text eol=lf

# Exclude local/private artifacts from source archives as a second line of defense.
.claude/** export-ignore
.codex/** export-ignore
.agents/** export-ignore
.tmp/** export-ignore
testImages/** export-ignore
out*/** export-ignore
eval_3way/** export-ignore
curated-*/** export-ignore
.env* export-ignore
NEW_CHAT_HANDOFF.md export-ignore
PROJECT_ASSESSMENT.md export-ignore
